config MIEV
	tristate "MiSight event provider"
	default m
	help
	  Build the MiSight kernel event provider.  It implements the
	  cdev_tevent_* ABI used by Xiaomi display, charger, audio and UFS
	  diagnostics and exposes the resulting records through /dev/miev.
